LeBron James is bringing his passion for golf to his hometown. 

@KingJames and the @PGATOUR are partnering to host the LeBron James Family Foundation Invitational next July at Firestone Country Club, an event for underrepresented aspiring professional golfers. 

Proceeds from the function will benefit the Akron community.

